full-query: "A Database Engineer is working on a project that involves a content management system (CMS) with a large number of images and documents being uploaded and accessed by users. The application is currently using Cloud Storage for storing the content, and the engineer is tasked with optimizing cost and performance. Which of the following strategies should the engineer implement to best achieve these objectives?"
