  "tip": "<p>Align storage classes to measured <i>access patterns</i> for cost savings and pair that with a cache for <i>hot</i> objects to boost performance. Avoid moving large binary files into a transactional database when Cloud Storage with lifecycle rules is a better fit.</p>",
